WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.667
Three letters. One connected world.

00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:21.300
First, give the computer input.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:30.467
The CPU follows instructions.

00:00:30.467 --> 00:00:40.100
RAM is the working space.

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:49.300
Storage keeps saved files.

00:00:49.300 --> 00:01:00.000
Communication connects devices.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:12.767
Put the pieces together.

00:01:12.767 --> 00:01:23.800
Your turn: RAM or SSD?
